s pages. Then the outer break `if (scanMgr->scanIndex >= scanMgr->totalEntries)` never triggers until 6 records found on page 1. ✓\n\nLet me also verify the C-pattern with first_data_page_num that should be 1, but is initialized to -1. Yes, in C the createTable initializes firstDataPageNum=-1, and the next() in C inherits this. So my behavior matches.\n\nNow let me verify cargo build is still clean and final:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":437,"cache_read_input_tokens":163365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":437,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b56e94b9-71d8-4e9b-996f-5bb9f9cbab5e","uuid":"01e2a8a2-208a-49fb-8c30-76d3bb05698c"}
